; Two-hop convert on one exchange at one second: 0.01 BTC -> 600 USDT ->
; 0.2 ETH, booked as four plain equity:trading legs under one narration.
; Ranked by raw amount across commodities the sells are [BTC 0.01, USDT 600]
; and the buys [ETH 0.2, USDT 600], which used to link BTC with ETH and USDT
; with USDT. Each sell must link to the buy of a different commodity in its
; own hop: BTC with USDT, USDT with ETH.

2025-05-01 12:00:00 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:btc-sell
    assets:exchange:kraken -0.01 BTC
    equity:trading 0.01 BTC

2025-05-01 12:00:00 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:usdt-buy
    assets:exchange:kraken 600 USDT
    equity:trading -600 USDT

2025-05-01 12:00:00 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:usdt-sell
    assets:exchange:kraken -600 USDT
    equity:trading 600 USDT

2025-05-01 12:00:00 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:eth-buy
    assets:exchange:kraken 0.2 ETH
    equity:trading -0.2 ETH
